"You can translate the interface on <a "
"href=\"https://explore.transifex.com/davidsansome/clementine-remot/\">this "
"Transifex project</a>."
msgstr "Sa võid tõlkida meie kasutajaliidest <a href=\"https://explore.transifex.com/davidsansome/clementine-remot/\">selle Transifex'i projekti abil</a>."

